# Zone source for the tzdata consumer program.
#
# Authored for this fork.  Daylight saving time runs in 2030 from 02:00 local
# standard time on the Sunday on or after 8 March until 02:00 local daylight
# time on the Sunday on or after 1 November.

Rule	CN	2030	2030	-	Mar	Sun>=8	2:00	1:00	-
Rule	CN	2030	2030	-	Nov	Sun>=1	2:00	0	-

Zone	Etc/Consumer	-5:00	CN	Cst/Cdt
Zone	Etc/ConsumerUTC	0	-	UTC
